= Wave 1: Adult Mods

*Policy.* This category is for readers 18+ only. Per project rules, adult/nude content is allowed only with explicit per-mod user approval — so nothing is included by default.

== Why this section exists

The guide reserves this section so approved adult mods can be documented without forcing them on every reader.

== Approval process

1. Propose a specific mod (name + source) for review.
2. Confirm it targets GTA V Enhanced 1.0.1158.13 and doesn't conflict with any adopted mod.
3. On approval, it is documented here with the same entry format as the other waves.

*No adult mods are currently listed.*
